.TH UDP_BROADCAST.PY 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-downtime-logger 0.1.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
udp_broadcast.py \- UDP heartbeat test producer for the UdpDetector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python \-m tools.udp_broadcast
.RB [ \-\-host
.IR HOST ]
.RB [ \-\-port
.IR PORT ]
.RB [ \-\-state
.BR running | stopped | heartbeat ]
.RB [ \-\-interval
.IR SECS ]
.RB [ \-\-once ]
.RB [ \-\-message
.IR TEXT ]
.br
.B python tools/udp_broadcast.py
.I ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diagnostic tool shipped with
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1).
It sends one UDP datagram per interval to
.IR HOST : PORT
from a socket with
.B SO_BROADCAST
set.
The bodies for
.B \-\-state
are
.BR "DAQ STATE running" ,
.B DAQ STATE stopped
and
.BR "heartbeat tick" ,
which the detector reads as UP, DOWN and UP (heartbeat).
.PP
.B UdpDetector
binds its socket and accepts datagrams from any sender without
authentication; any host that can reach the port can drive it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-host " HOST"
Destination address.
Default
.B 255.255.255.255
(limited broadcast).
A detector bound to 127.0.0.1, as in
.IR config/local.yaml ,
does not receive limited broadcasts on Linux; use
.B \-\-host 127.0.0.1
for that configuration.
.TP
.BI \-\-port " PORT"
Destination port.
Default
.BR 9000 .
.TP
.BR \-\-state " {" running | stopped | heartbeat }
Choose the body.
Default
.BR running .
.TP
.BI \-\-interval " SECS"
Seconds between datagrams.
Default
.BR 1.0 .
Keep it below the detector's
.BR heartbeat_timeout_s .
.TP
.B \-\-once
Send one datagram and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-message " TEXT"
Send
.I TEXT
instead of the
.B \-\-state
body.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
.B \-\-once
completed.
.TP
.B 1
Socket error (uncaught
.BR OSError ).
.TP
.B 2
Usage error.
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted with Ctrl\-C.
.SH EXAMPLES
Keep the
.I local.yaml
UDP detector UP:
.PP
.RS
.nf
python \-m tools.udp_broadcast \-\-host 127.0.0.1 \-\-port 9000 \-\-state running
.fi
.RE
.PP
Send one stop to a detector on another host:
.PP
.RS
.nf
python \-m tools.udp_broadcast \-\-host CONSOLE_HOST \-\-state stopped \-\-once
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger\-api (7),
.BR zmq_publish.py (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Andrew Norman and the Mu2e DAQ group, Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory.
